---
import Reveal from './Reveal.astro';
---

<section class="now" id="now">
	<div class="wrap now-grid">
		<div class="now-label">
			<span class="eyebrow">Now</span>
			<div class="micro now-when">Updated 14 May</div>
		</div>
		<div class="now-body">
			<p class="serif">
				Mid-rewrite of an analytics ingestion path that, on a good day, eats
				eleven thousand events a second and tells nobody about it.
			</p>
			<p>
				Otherwise: reading Hillel Wayne's <em>Logic for Programmers</em>,
				cooking my way through a stubborn loaf of rye, and trying to learn
				enough Rust to feel mildly dangerous.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
